WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:51.390
Someone once said:

00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:55.960
There are sunflowers that look like cooked 
rice sticks when they're in bloom...  {this one's brutal}

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:00.160
Cooked Rice Sunflower Sticks!

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:07.570
Between crispy sandwich wafer leaves, 
there's plenty of sweet vanilla,

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:14.380
strawberry, and chocolate cream 
that melts in your mouth...

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:17.810
Lotus wafers!

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:22.480
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:29.190
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:35.560
The bond between Toriko and Komatsu deepened

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:38.570
as they pushed their way through 
a harsh natural environment.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:43.800
At last, they reached the Vegetable Sky,

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.940
a vegetable field 20,000 
meters above sea level.

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:55.150
To Toriko, who aims to set 
foot in the Gourmet World,

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.920
this journey provided the 
perfect training ground.

00:03:00.290 --> 00:03:03.290
Toriko and Komatsu discovered Ozone Grass,

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:06.890
a high-altitude growing grass 
known as the King of Vegetables!

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:22.240
Komatsu realized that the key to eating it

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:26.240
is opening two of its leaves simultaneously.

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:32.220
The two successfully 
captured the Ozone Grass!

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:38.720
The only way to eat Ozone Grass is 
also with two people at the same time.

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:43.130
And so, Komatsu and Toriko chewed 
the delicious veggie together.

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:49.170
As a result, the level of Toriko's 
Gourmet Cells evolved even further.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:53.800
Toriko then made a proposal to Komatsu, 
who had developed to the point

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.470
where he could hear the 
voices of the ingredients.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:04:02.750
You... ever thought of teaming up with me?

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:10.850
Well, you know... If you're up for it...

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:17.090
Let's team up, and make the 
ultimate Full Course, together.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:22.270
Yes! I hope I can be of service!

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:28.910
But then, a mysterious being 
suddenly appeared in front of them!

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:35.510
Shocking Encounter! A 
Mysterious Life Form Appears!

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:51.290
A GT Robot...

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.600
No...

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.070
That footprint!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.520
T-Toriko-san!

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:18.520
Don't move, Komatsu.

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:27.090
We mustn't make any foolish moves.

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:31.170
This thing has me at a loss, but for the 
moment, I'm not sensing any hostility.

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:36.370
Don't worry. If anything 
happens, I'll protect you.

00:05:36.370 --> 00:05:38.470
That's only natural for partners.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.740
Toriko-san...

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.360
W-What was that... just now?

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.030
W-Was it a GT Robot?

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:20.200
No. Not a robot...

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:23.310
It looked similar,

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:26.510
but it didn't have the characteristic 
titanium alloy smell of the GT Robots.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:28.240
And if it were a robot,

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:31.550
I would've been able to sense the 
human operator's remote presence.

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:37.550
There's no doubt about it. 
That was a wild beast!

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:41.790
Then is it a native inhabitant 
of the Vegetable Sky?!

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.490
No. Its odor was different than 
anything I've ever smelled.

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:47.430
My theory is it's a beast from another land.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:51.230
Not the Human World, but another one...

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:54.870
If that's true... then what did it want?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:59.540
Maybe it just came to partake of 
the Vegetable Sky... That, or...

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:03.350
Come to think of it, it 
ate the Ozone Grass...

00:08:03.350 --> 00:08:05.150
But then spit it out...

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:07.280
It had probably turned rotten.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:09.450
If you don't eat the Ozone Grass with 
another person at the same time...

00:08:22.130 --> 00:08:23.200
What?!

00:08:31.170 --> 00:08:33.870
I don't believe it... How...?!

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:37.980
Did it bite down two times?!

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:43.780
Biting twice with such speed even the Ozone 
Grass didn't realize it wasn't simultaneous!

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:48.990
Impossible! How can it have 
such instantaneous force?!

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:50.390
Toriko-san...

00:08:50.390 --> 00:08:55.300
That guy might've been watching 
us from somewhere the whole time.

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.930
How to peel the Ozone Grass 
leaves, how to eat it...

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:04.700
That thing learned by watching us do it!

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.410
It learned...?

00:09:07.410 --> 00:09:10.510
I'm guessing its goal was the Ozone Grass,

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:12.810
but it probably didn't know how to eat it.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:16.650
It learned how to eat the grass 
just by watching us do it once?!

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:17.620
Yeah.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:20.090
We got the Ozone Grass after deciding

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:22.050
it was impossible to peel the leaves alone.

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:26.360
It saw that and then came out to eat.

00:09:27.430 --> 00:09:31.630
It possesses a high level of 
intelligence and astonishing agility.

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:35.130
But...

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:37.740
After going through all that to eat it...

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:40.710
...only to spit out such 
a delicious vegetable...

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:43.140
That animal is some kind of choosy!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:49.950
You're probably right.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:53.220
High intelligence or not, it sure doesn't 
know a good thing when it eats it!

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:56.620
Yep! Anyway, I'm just glad 
nothing happened between us.

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.690
Alright, Komatsu! What do you 
say we get some more Ozone Grass

00:09:58.690 --> 00:10:00.630
and take it home to the old man?

00:10:00.630 --> 00:10:04.630
U-Um... Toriko-san... on the way back...

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:08.330
Uh... We have to do it ourselves again, huh?

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.630
Of course!

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:13.370
I knew it!

00:10:13.370 --> 00:10:17.640
It'll be fine! To get back, all we need to 
do is jump down, so it's a piece of cake!

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:21.010
Jumping down from here is no simple task!

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.450
Come on, Toriko-san!

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:24.450
Toriko-san, let's reconsider!

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.050
Toriko-san, are you listening to me?!

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:29.450
Please listen to me once in a while!

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:32.260
What the hell was that thing?

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.290
Mr. President!

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:12.960
The Gourmet Cabinet Minister 
from the Shiba Kingdom,

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.600
Mr. Momonba, is here to see you.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:16.030
What does he want?!

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:17.600
I'm busy right now!

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:19.130
Have him come back later!

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:21.300
But he has an appointment...

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:24.670
Huh? Then just ask him what he's here for.

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:27.940
Also, President Wappen 
of the Monba Republic...

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:29.880
I'm busy! Later!

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:32.850
Mr. President! There's yet another guest...

00:11:32.850 --> 00:11:34.120
I'm busy I said!

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:36.050
Would you see Mr. Toriko?

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:37.690
What?! Toriko?!

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:43.490
That's right, I did ask you to get that!

00:11:43.490 --> 00:11:45.560
What, did you forget about it, old man?!

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:47.960
I'm impressed you were 
able to bring that back.

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:51.870
Ozone Grass is a Special Preparation 
Ingredient with Capture Level 68.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:53.500
It's thanks to this guy!

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:55.570
Let me introduce you.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:58.640
This is the chef I've 
teamed up with, Komatsu.

00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:01.480
I-I-I-It's nice to meet you!

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:08.880
I-I'm Komatsu. With your kind permission, 
I'm a chef at Hotel Gourmet.

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:12.090
Oh, so you're my... that 
is, an employee of IGO.

00:12:12.090 --> 00:12:16.920
Y-Yes. I-It's an honor to meet you!

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.460
You're too nervous!

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:21.190
This Gourmet Case...

00:12:21.190 --> 00:12:24.700
Are you the one who programmed 
it to preserve the Ozone Grass?

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:29.940
Y-Yes. No one sells the 
data card for Ozone Grass,

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:33.270
so I entered the numerical values for 
temperature and air pressure on site.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:35.440
It did take quite a few hours, though...

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:37.380
I see...

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:39.780
And can you perceive the 
voices of the ingredients?

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:41.210
Toriko!

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:42.150
Yeah?

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.680
You found a good chef.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.490
Take good care of your partner.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.390
I will...

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:51.160
Bitter! What is this?!

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:56.060
That's Ozone Tea, made from the 
outer leaves of the Ozone Grass.

00:12:56.260 --> 00:12:59.260
Ozone Tea?! Outer leaves...

00:12:59.260 --> 00:13:02.130
It's extremely bitter, but if you 
get used to it, you'll get hooked.

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:03.400
Wait a sec, old man!

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.400
Are you tellin' me you already 
have plenty of Ozone Grass?!

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:06.070
Yeah, so?

00:13:06.270 --> 00:13:08.970
Then why did you bother 
asking me to capture some?!

00:13:08.970 --> 00:13:12.280
Fool! It was for your training, naturally!

00:13:12.280 --> 00:13:14.250
See, going into the Gourmet 
World inexperienced as you are

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:16.950
would be like throwing your life away!

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:20.350
If we're talking about cold and low 
oxygen levels, I've already adapted.

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:22.050
So now I'm ready for the Gourmet World...

00:13:22.050 --> 00:13:22.950
Dumbass!

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:28.060
There are still a heap of environments 
you have to be able to adapt to.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.600
Here! Your next assignment!

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:36.330
What?! Another request?!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.200
There are several more!

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.970
You're gonna capture every single 
ingredient listed on that page!

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:45.140
And until you do, I refuse to allow 
you to enter the Gourmet World.

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:46.840
This is your training!

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:48.480
I don't believe this...

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:52.120
As we speak, Sunny and Coco are training

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:55.290
to adapt to various environmental 
conditions, too!

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:57.850
The same as you...

00:13:57.850 --> 00:13:59.660
Sunny and Coco?!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:12.800
Sorry, but I just don't have time 
to babysit my little sister!

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:16.770
So you really don't know 
where Toriko is, Big Bro?!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.480
I'm not his keeper either!

00:14:20.480 --> 00:14:23.550
Jeez! Always with the nauseating 
questions about Toriko!

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.280
Excuse me?!

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:30.420
I'm just curious about where 
Toriko is right now, that's all!

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:32.290
That reaction makes me sick to my stomach!

00:14:32.290 --> 00:14:34.990
What?! You're so stingy with info, Bro!

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:36.790
Stingy! Stingy! Stingy!

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:38.160
What's going on?

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:39.690
The helicopter's ready to go?!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.760
It's all set!

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:44.830
Well, I'm off...

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.470
Then so am I!

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.140
Hah?!

00:14:49.140 --> 00:14:52.740
You're obviously going somewhere where 
you can get great skin and hair care!

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:54.440
It's no fair if you go alone!

00:14:57.780 --> 00:15:00.620
Is Toriko going, too?! Hey, Bro!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.980
No one else is going!

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.450
From here on out, I'm on my own.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.700
It's Coco-sama!

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:23.700
Welcome back, Coco-sama!

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:26.310
Coco-sama's back!

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:27.640
Where were you?!

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:29.740
Tell my fortune, too!

00:15:34.050 --> 00:15:35.180
Don't push!

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:41.020
I'm sorry. I don't think 
I'll be home for a while.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:44.320
Kiss!

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:03.610
Depending on the ingredient, 
you can invite those two along.

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:05.440
It'd be good training for them, too.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.280
And also...

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:10.050
...for Zebra!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:13.150
Zebra?! But he's...

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.150
Toriko!

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:17.420
After this, I'm going into the Gourmet World.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:20.030
If you boys feel up to it...

00:16:20.360 --> 00:16:22.690
...make yourselves stronger, then follow me!

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:24.400
Old man...

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:27.630
Yeah! I'll be along soon, so wait for me!

00:16:27.630 --> 00:16:29.800
And so, Komatsu-kun...

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.070
Y-Yes?!

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:34.110
I'm looking forward to seeing you there, too.

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:37.240
Right! Thank you!

00:16:37.240 --> 00:16:39.080
The Gourmet World...

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:42.910
I bet I'll find tons of ingredients 
I've never laid eyes on before!

00:16:42.910 --> 00:16:46.680
Oh, when the conversation turns to food, 
you sure perk right up, don't you?!

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:50.490
Yep! Boy, I can't wait!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:54.660
Sure, but we're talking about the 
Gourmet World. Aren't you scared?

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:58.530
Toriko-san, I've been with you to 
a cave where a Devil Python lived

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:02.170
and freezing Ice Hell, after all...

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:05.670
So you're confident! But in the 
Gourmet World, the waterfalls drop

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:09.770
a trillion liters of water 
one-kilometer-thick per minute.

00:17:09.770 --> 00:17:12.240
And in the desert, the temperature 
is usually 60 degrees,

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:14.580
with sandstorms and shifting sand.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.950
I hear its severity is unrivaled!

00:17:17.780 --> 00:17:20.050
P-Please spare me the details!

00:17:20.050 --> 00:17:22.220
In the end, you're the 
same old nervous Komatsu!

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:25.560
Sorry! But I'll still go...

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:25.190
Toriko and Komatsu-kun, eh?

00:17:25.860 --> 00:17:28.960
They remind me of Acacia-sensei 
and Froese-sama...

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:33.600
With these two, maybe someday...

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:34.830
Oh, that's right!

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:38.130
We saw a weird creature in Vegetable Sky.

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:39.030
Huh?

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:42.400
It looked like one of the 
Gourmet Corp.'s GT Robots,

00:17:42.400 --> 00:17:46.040
but I'm positive it was no robot.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.880
It was a wild beast.

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:48.840
What?!

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:50.080
Old man?

00:17:51.510 --> 00:17:54.280
Work hard at your training, Toriko.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:06.630
I'm flabbergasted. To think it would 
come as far as the Human World...

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.870
There you are.

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:59.610
Oh! Instant Pickled Ozone Grass!

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:02.220
From Chef Komatsu!

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:03.120
Huh?

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:08.820
He dropped some off here after 
getting back from Vegetable Sky.

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:10.890
Oh, that boy...

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:12.760
A perfect way to wrap up the night.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:14.690
How about joining me?

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:15.790
Oh?

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:18.600
In that case, I'll have a bit.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:24.500
This brings back memories.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.540
We often ate this in the sky long ago...

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:32.880
This is on the house.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:40.420
Huh? You'd turn down sake?

00:19:40.420 --> 00:19:42.150
That's unusual.

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:46.990
I have an uneasy feeling.

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:52.000
Certainly, there's something in the air...

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:04.440
We have to hurry...

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:07.210
...before the world falls to ruin.

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:13.080
Sabrina

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.320
Pa-pa-pa-para

00:20:16.690 --> 00:20:18.160
Sabrina

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:27.260
Rainy day, danced down on the night city

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:34.140
You had deep red lipstick on you

00:20:34.140 --> 00:20:37.910
Like you were toyed with

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.340
Like you were tasted

00:20:41.340 --> 00:20:48.450
A solitary silhouette seen through the glass

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:55.190
One day, one day... Search for true love

00:20:55.190 --> 00:21:02.260
Even if hurt by the lies going around town

00:21:02.260 --> 00:21:07.000
Rottening fruit

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:08.570
Sabrina

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:14.640
Gourmet News!

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:18.080
I'm your host, Tina!

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:20.080
Instant Pickled Ozone Grass!

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:22.580
I can't get enough!

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:26.090
It makes me wanna have a heaping 
helping of white rice in the morning!

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:29.560
But with Ozone Grass, you 
normally can't eat it alone.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:31.030
I'm so envious...

00:21:31.030 --> 00:21:33.790
And so, on to the next story...

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:37.770
Wait! It looks like you're in 
another pickle, Signora Tina!

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:40.330
Could he be here this week, too?!

00:21:45.310 --> 00:21:46.970
Buon giorno!

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:53.510
Everyone! The owner-chef of a famous 
Italian restaurant in the Gourmet Tower,

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:56.280
and the Fantasista of the Kitchen, saving 
countless housewives and career women...

00:21:56.280 --> 00:22:00.320
Taccino Kawagoe-san is 
paying us another visit!

00:22:00.320 --> 00:22:04.860
Alright, this week, I'll be introducing 
a simple recipe to make my favorite

00:22:04.860 --> 00:22:10.130
Italian-style pickles with a fresh 
and juicy vegetable like Ozone Grass.

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:11.430
Please!

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:12.230
Si!

00:22:13.230 --> 00:22:17.240
Put some vinegar, olive oil, 
and soy sauce in a bowl.

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:21.940
Then add in some eggplant that you've 
already heated up in the microwave.

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:25.540
Now this is the most important point.

00:22:25.540 --> 00:22:27.910
Put cola in the bowl.

00:22:31.080 --> 00:22:34.990
Taccino Fantasy!

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:38.720
Instant Pickled Eggplant

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:46.030
A heaping helping of buono!

00:22:46.030 --> 00:22:48.230
With a heaping helping of 
white rice on the side...

00:22:50.640 --> 00:22:52.140
Buono!

00:22:52.140 --> 00:22:55.570
To all the signors, signoras, 
and signorinas watching,

00:22:55.570 --> 00:22:58.180
I hope this favorite flavor 
of mine reaches you!

00:22:58.180 --> 00:23:00.780
Well, see you again! Ciao!

00:23:00.780 --> 00:23:02.210
Ciao!

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:04.780
And now, on to the next story for real!

00:23:06.980 --> 00:23:10.440
His pulse hastens, his excitement heightens, his curiosity: unstoppable!

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:13.990
Toriko tests his skills against the Gourmet World!

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:17.130
Toriko Rushes In! The Truth of the Gourmet World!

00:23:17.130 --> 00:23:19.210
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
